From: Phil Taylor <phil@m0vse.uk>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: preserve accepted operating state and propagate setup failures

Only OpenWiFi generated package sources are changed. Preserve OWE refresh,
legacy radio startup, existing MLO/DFS/regulatory paths and all other patches.

--- a/package/network/services/hostapd/Makefile
+++ b/package/network/services/hostapd/Makefile
@@ -1 +1 @@
-PKG_RELEASE:=1
+PKG_RELEASE:=2
--- a/package/network/services/hostapd/src/src/ap/ucode.c
+++ b/package/network/services/hostapd/src/src/ap/ucode.c
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
